---
---
<section id="como-funciona" class="how-it-works-section">
  <div class="how-container">
    <header class="how-header">
      <span class="how-badge">Passo a Passo</span>
      <h2 class="category-title">Como Funciona?</h2>
      <p class="how-subtitle">
        Sem complicação! Você escolhe e nós cuidamos de tudo em 4 passos simples.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="steps-grid">
      <!-- Passo 01 -->
      <div class="step-card">
        <div class="step-header">
          <div class="step-number">01</div>
          <div class="step-line" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        </div>
        <h3 class="step-title">Escolha seu modelo</h3>
        <p class="step-desc">
          Navegue pelo catálogo e encontre o layout ideal para o seu segmento ou estilo de marca.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Passo 02 -->
      <div class="step-card">
        <div class="step-header">
          <div class="step-number">02</div>
          <div class="step-line" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        </div>
        <h3 class="step-title">Envie as informações</h3>
        <p class="step-desc">
          Mande sua logo, fotos, textos e links. Nós orientamos tudo o que for necessário via WhatsApp.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Passo 03 -->
      <div class="step-card">
        <div class="step-header">
          <div class="step-number">03</div>
          <div class="step-line" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        </div>
        <h3 class="step-title">Nós personalizamos</h3>
        <p class="step-desc">
          Configuramos a página com as suas cores e dados para que fique exatamente com a identidade da sua empresa.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Passo 04 -->
      <div class="step-card">
        <div class="step-header">
          <div class="step-number">04</div>
        </div>
        <h3 class="step-title">Receba seu link</h3>
        <p class="step-desc">
          Entregamos seu Mini Site em até 48h com hospedagem inclusa e pronto para colar na bio!
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Sora:wght@600;700;800&family=Inter:wght@400;500&display=swap');

.how-it-works-section {
  padding: 80px 20px;
  background-color: var(--bg-soft, #130d1b);
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.how-container {
  max-width: 1200px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

.how-header {
  text-align: center;
  margin-bottom: 56px;
}

.how-badge {
  display: inline-block;
  font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
  font-size: 0.78rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  color: var(--highlight, #a855f7);
  background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.12);
  border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.25);
  padding: 5px 14px;
  border-radius: 20px;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.how-header h2 {
  font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
  font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.4rem);
  font-weight: 800;
  color: #ffffff;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.how-subtitle {
  color: var(--text-muted, #c4b8d7);
  font-size: 1.02rem;
  max-width: 500px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

.steps-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 24px;
}

.step-card {
  background: linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(38, 25, 58, 0.6) 0%, rgba(19, 13, 27, 0.8) 100%);
  border: 1px solid var(--border-soft, rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.2));
  border-radius: 16px;
  padding: 28px 20px;
  position: relative;
  backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
  transition: transform 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}

.step-card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-6px);
  border-color: var(--highlight, #a855f7);
  box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.2);
}

.step-header {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
  position: relative;
}

.step-number {
  font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
  font-size: 1.1rem;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: #ffffff;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary, #8343c3), var(--highlight, #a855f7));
  width: 44px;
  height: 44px;
  border-radius: 12px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.3);
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

.step-line {
  height: 2px;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.4), transparent);
  flex-grow: 1;
  margin-left: 12px;
}

.step-title {
  font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
  font-size: 1.15rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #ffffff;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.step-desc {
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  color: var(--text-muted, #c4b8d7);
  line-height: 1.6;
  margin: 0;
}

/* Responsividade */
@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .steps-grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  }
}

@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .how-it-works-section {
    padding: 50px 20px;
  }

  .steps-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .step-line {
    display: none;
  }

  .step-card {
    padding: 22px 18px;
  }
}
</style>